# Allowlist: the image needs only the Rust workspace, the web app and the
# entrypoint. Everything else stays out of the build context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!web/
!docker/

# Build output and local state inside the allowed folders
**/target
**/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/.DS_Store
